{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"property","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL18MXLHammerOnPullOffV6numberAA14MXLNumberLevelVvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","title":"number","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"number","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLNumberLevelV","text":"MXLNumberLevel","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHammerOnPullOff\/number"},"abstract":[{"text":"Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHammerOnPullOff"]]},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlhammeronpulloff\/number"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"number","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLNumberLevel","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLNumberLevelV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNumberLevel","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to the MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"number"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLNumberLevel":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlnumberlevel","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLNumberLevel","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLNumberLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Slurs, tuplets, and many other features can be concurrent and overlap within a single musical part. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"number-level entity distinguishes up to 16 concurrent objects of the same type when the objects overlap in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"MusicXML document order. Values greater than 6 are usually only needed for music with a large number of divisi"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"staves in a single part, or if there are more than 6 cross-staff arpeggios in a single measure. When a number-"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"level value is implied, the value is 1 by default."}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLNumberLevel","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLNumberLevel"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLHammerOnPullOff":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The hammer-on and pull-off elements are used in guitar and fretted instrument notation. Since a single slur"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can be marked over many notes, the hammer-on and pull-off elements are separate so the individual pair of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notes can be specified. The element content can be used to specify how the hammer-on or pull-off should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"notated. An empty element leaves this choice up to the application."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHammerOnPullOff","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlhammeronpulloff","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MXLHammerOnPullOff","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MXLHammerOnPullOff","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLHammerOnPullOff","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLHammerOnPullOff/number":{"abstract":[{"text":"Defaults to ","type":"text"},{"code":"1","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLHammerOnPullOff\/number","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlhammeronpulloff\/number","title":"number","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"number","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL14MXLNumberLevelV","text":"MXLNumberLevel","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","title":"IvorMXL","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","kind":"symbol"}}}